Package: targetsworktree
Title: Safe Targets Stores for Git Worktrees
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Thomas",
    family = "Gade Koefoed",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "thomas.koefoed@sund.ku.dk"
  )
Description: Configures snapshot-backed targets stores in existing Git
    worktrees, links the snapshot values each guarded run needs into a
    writable store, reconciles them with the current code, and quarantines
    writable output during teardown.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.5.0)
Imports:
    crew,
    targets,
    tidyselect,
    withr
Suggests:
    processx
URL: https://github.com/koefoeden/targetsworktree
BugReports: https://github.com/koefoeden/targetsworktree/issues
SystemRequirements: git, flock
